  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY & RULES



    OBJECTIVE

    Survive as long as you can!
    Jump onto moving platforms and climb higher without falling.



    CONTROLS

    -
    Left / Right: Tap & Hold to move.

    - Jump: Tap to leap.

    - Double Jump:
    Tap Jump again in mid-air for extra height!



    RULES

    - Falling into
    the spikes at the bottom triggers instant Game Over!



'
